docs {
  # fast-api-data-migration

  Read-only API over the Summit health-coaching dataset.

  Pick an environment (top-right) before sending requests:

  - **Local Docker** — API on `http://localhost:8000`, backed by the throwaway
    local Postgres container.
  - **Live RDS** — API on `http://localhost:8001`, backed by the real AWS RDS
    through the SSM tunnel.

  Each environment's docs has the exact command to launch the API against that
  backend. The sample path-param ids (`patient_id`, `coach_id`) and filter values
  live in the environment vars and on each request.
}
